@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam dpi 160
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
hide empty members
top to bottom direction
component "Editor JavaScript\ny lienzo SVG" as UI
component "Lector local\nOCR y transcripción" as AI
component "Colaboración cliente" as CC
component "API FastAPI" as API
component "Servicio colaborativo" as SC
component "Validación y\nmodelo UML" as M
component "Generadores y\nadaptadores" as GEN
component "Gemini externo" as G
UI ..> AI : invoca
UI ..> CC : cambios
UI ..> API : HTTP
CC ..> SC : WebSocket
API ..> M : valida
API ..> GEN : delega
GEN ..> M : utiliza
API ..> G : consulta opcional
SC ..> M : valida estructura
note bottom of AI
Whisper y Tesseract se ejecutan
localmente en el flujo del editor.
end note
@enduml
